Package: tabs3-sensors
Version: 0.1.1
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: tabS3 Project <root@localhost>
Depends: libc6, libqrtr1, systemd, udev
Recommends: iio-sensor-proxy
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Sensor DSP registry and sensor setup for the Galaxy Tab S3 LTE
 Serves the sensor DSP (SLPI) its registry over QRTR with sns-reg, patched to
 serve the binary registry image of Samsung's Android, and describes the
 accelerometer's mounting for iio-sensor-proxy, and binds the SX9310 grip
 sensor once the DSP is up (its probe at boot runs a moment too early). The
 registry image derives from the tablet's own Android software and is
 installed separately; see tools/sensor-registry in the tabS3 repository.
